# Kebu + RECT Ecosystem

Full spec: `docs/product/KEBU-RECT-ECOSYSTEM.md`

## Distinction (non-negotiable)

| | Role |
|--|------|
| **KEBU** | **Build and operate** — account, ID, Builder, Shop, Cloud, Search, business infra |
| **RECT** | **Create, distribute, discover, monetize culture** — audiences, creators, cultural network |
| **Kebu Reach** | Connect **money to attention** — campaigns, placement, attribution (not banner-only) |

**Kebu is NOT the entertainment/media company.** Do not merge RECT into Kebu as one tangled app.

## Interlock

RECT creates **audiences** → Kebu lets people **capture economic value** → Reach **connects** brands/creators/customers.

- **Create Store** on RECT → handoff to **Kebu Builder/Shop** (same Kebu Account)  
- **Culture** in Kebu Search indexes RECT (attribution) — not separate login  
- **Creator Marketplace** (RECT) + **Reach** tracking views→clicks→sales — NOT STARTED until slice  

## Creator model

Creator **business profile** (Kebu ID) — engaged audience by geography, not vanity followers only. Performance reputation from **attributed outcomes**.

## Engineering

Separate product schemas (RECT artist/social ≠ Kebu business) — **API + shared account** integration. Privacy: permissioned audience insights, revocable.

## Forbidden

Kebu as media company · fake creator/campaign metrics · auto-publish store from RECT without confirm · RECT schemas dumped into Kebu DB without migration slice.

Flywheel: **CREATE → AUDIENCE → BUSINESS → REVENUE → DATA → FINANCING → SCALE**
